        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur PARFGR, Grandeur Parthenon Handleset</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nGrandeur's Parthenon F Grip Handleset design embodies a decorative style that has adorned classic American and European homes for over one hundred and fifty years. The decorative detailing speaks volumes about the pride and commitment of the artisans that bring the design to life. The elegant styling captured by the Parthenon Handleset has been a favorite of homeowners for centuries. Fashioned from solid, premium-grade brass it has a lifetime mechanical warranty. Grandeur door locks include features such as spring assisted inside trim to make them robust. This high quality solid forged brass entry set includes a high security deadbolt. This handleset fits doors 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" thick with a 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\" backset. Available in dummy, single cylinder, or double cylinder handlesets in a wide array of finishes. For an authentic looking restoration projects or simply to achieve a distinctive romantic look, no decorative door hardware makes a more profound statement than Grandeur.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nClick here to see the entire <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-decorative\"><b>Grandeur</b></a> - <a href=\"/collections/grandeur-parthenon-series\"><b>Parthenon Series</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur PARFGR Parthenon F Grip Decorative Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>One inch throw deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Grandeur Parthenon Handleset:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Height: 3.34\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Deadbolt Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Height: 5.35\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Top Width: 2.62\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Bottom Diameter: 1.28\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Overall Height: 16.69\"</li>\r\n<li>Exterior Projection: 3\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/4\" to 2-1/4\" with optional thick door kit for doors up to 2-1/2\" thick.</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Bore Hole Distance: minimum 4-3/8\" center to center.</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-handleset.pdf?v=1704262176\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur Handleset Exploded View (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/PARFGR-handleset.pdf?v=1704262177\" target=\"new\"><b>Parthenon \"F\" Grip Handleset Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting a Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n\r\n<li><b>Single Cylinder Handleset:</b> From the exterior, a thumb piece operates the latch and a key operates the deadbolt. From the interior, the lever operates the latch and a thumbturn operates the deadbolt.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Cylinder Handleset:</b> The deadbolt is key operated form both the interior and the exterior while the latch underneath the deadbolt is operated by a turn knob/lever from the interior and a thumbpiece from the exterior.</li>\r\n<li><b>Dummy Handleset:</b> This handleset is does not function--neither locking nor latching.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Note:</b> Inside trim levers are handed. <a href=\"/pages/how-to-order-door-hardware\"><b>Click Here to determine left or right handed.</b></a>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Parthenon F Grip Decorative Handleset, Grandeur PARFGR",
                "description": "Grandeur PARFGR Grandeur Newport Handleset - Grandeur's Parthenon F Grip Handleset design embodies a decorative style that has adorned classic American and European homes for over one hundred and fifty years. The decorative detailing speaks volumes about the pride and commitment of the artisans that bring the design to life. The elegant styling captured by the Parthenon Handleset has been a favorite of homeowners for centuries. Fashioned from solid, premium-grade brass it has a lifetime mechanical warranty. Grandeur door locks include features such as spring assisted inside trim to make them robust. This high quality solid forged brass entry set includes a high security deadbolt. This handleset fits doors 1-3/4 inches to 2-1/4 inches thick with a 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backset. Available in dummy, single, or double cylinder handlesets in a wide array of finishes. For an authentic looking restoration projects or simply to achieve a distinctive romantic look, no decorative door hardware makes a more profound statement than Grandeur.",
                "keywords": "GRA-PARFGR, Grandeur PARFGR, Parthenon F Grip Decorative Handlesets, Grandeur Newport Handlesets, dummy handlesets, single cylinder handlesets, double cylinder handlesets, ornate handlesetes, Parthenon entry handlesets,"
